Frontier Specialty Care Network (fictional) · 13,951 appointments and 1,786 waitlist entries · 6 months. Average lead time is 29.8 days and only 59.1% of appointments meet their specialty's access standard. Meanwhile 2,087 booked slots went unused through cancellation and no-show, and 507 of them were cancelled early enough to refill.</run></formatted-text></zone><zone h="18800" id="4" name="Lead time against each specialty's own access standard" w="100000" x="0" y="6000" /><zone h="18800" id="5" name="Appointment outcomes" w="100000" x="0" y="24800" /><zone h="18800" id="6" name="The reminder effect" w="100000" x="0" y="43600" /><zone h="18800" id="7" name="Longer waits, worse attendance" w="100000" x="0" y="62400" /><zone h="18800" id="8" name="What refilling cancelled slots would actually buy" w="100000" x="0" y="81200" /></zone></zone></zones></dashboard></dashboards></workbook>